{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 931,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38e80e816a1f199b69065483",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "速度有十二分迅速时大幅提升速度\\n智力也十二分超群时极大提升速度\\n＜先行・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "d584f099a5529c60e81a5a86ee92a79744d6d9d8e891959c84dae6eaf981bc38",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103202111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d90f8dc368fc2cdd92d29ccf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘速度提升,并根据自身速度\\n提升技能效果\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "b86593a8ec56a0643fe0aa7d631a4088a7eb46fd6b6e3709ab264b7c0429f58a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103202211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87f91b685fd34d906a5ac975",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近终盘时若位于前方\\n则速度提升,若是中距离比赛\\n则效果提升\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a00b542db962b25bade1f7e0a0323b9064ddd2658265abc9629451d80bc81e9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103203111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:beaf9a636242656210202d08",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "周围有很多赛马娘时速度提升\\n且在2000m的比赛中变为速度大幅提升\\n并使除自身以外的队友速度稍微提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc1c5d05cc451c501544bb251863d555d2f4dc32644cb80fc63df18b17363b94",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103203211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4471b180829fa9fbd52ee1f9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛后半且靠近弯道时\\n持久力少量恢复\\n且短时间内稍微提高速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "d71e9372407d3d38233cee2c37817273068261176e48c32e9e80cbea6a11c0a3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "10321"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a82d5a67ab1092511359f67c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "紧跟前方赛马娘时,回复持久力\\n并且稍微提升速度\\n＜作战・追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "bebdab9ce901dc1f4fa9a620c381b58ba0a33f610c6eeb3a5c772150b06981a8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103301111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b1e08b408a9c49d5f5a2881",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘时若身处后方\\n则在最后冲刺阶段的关键时刻\\n大幅提升速度＜作战・追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "c204360a6106aba30806fda2e15262603137f359730c3dc8a29c484dba5cdef6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103301211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84a620e9f9af34230250447e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘位于中后方时\\n速度大幅提升,若是2400m的比赛\\n则变为一段时间内速度大幅提升＜追赶・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "93a304cde02d6bbcda32301daeaa298b1f243b10656ac50160b2030eec886e40",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103302111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05f401cdf5193b4e6d2b329a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘初期大幅向前突进\\n若是2400m的比赛则一段时间内\\n大幅向前突进＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "54ae138daa59804cfd6a016e9f2d71e3b0bfc7a0ae4a863d5660d5cdc6d07974",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103302211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81c09c2bcfabf86b40812353",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时若发动大量技能\\n则速度大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4d072322a0b8ee1fa7313791f5f15187c5c92a46f2c7ca65e664d2b4fee5128",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103401111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2188fdc93681996f94f8a1d5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时若身处后方\\n则大幅回复持久力\\n并且提升速度＜沙土＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "da277804dfeb7250075faac315557a1bb13b026a6ad625e2393f3391c55245ce",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103401211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22106117a480bcad1e01a4ea",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘处于后方时\\n回复少量体力并大幅提升速度\\n＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "274b243f7b9bbefc8a4d69843ab3cd92c0cf6c938655934cd8535f32e36b2218",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103401221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3500e48c0b2cbfcc8deb185f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道上若身处内道\\n则速度大幅提升＜长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "89d925b011d2bbf80541280ce7ae5760d29eea3c22e5e23c1e12d5a592191168",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103402111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39f634fcdc7547603f707bd4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最后冲刺时若身处直线,大幅提升加速度\\n并且视野变得稍微广阔\\n＜作战・追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "d99ea2be1643fb3369f4b884db27d00a3c9504efcff400af8d470b33cf7a9f51",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103402211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56469ffc5a215b2ad147b062",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终冲刺的直线上提升加速度\\n之后进入最终弯道时\\n稍微向前突进＜追赶・长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "99ab5db118cab4fbbe2c1cf5c92fa0f89f40245bb550ac79bc3e2ac164c9d2d2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103402221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb7b269e8d3e1374a24d81ab",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当成功完成超越时\\n一段时间内加速度持续小幅提升\\n并且速度稍微提升＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "71727dc48a8e6f721176f4653485708734d2c35c3799d9a2a9d1b77c0d08e378",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103501111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e394cdf80069d41640a5e9e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时若身处中间集团之后\\n则速度提升,并稍微回复持久力\\n＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "749e7f86c59723d246bef07c3795af567bdeea27e02f51393e60c1b9074c6307",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103501211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00a9d0a626ffb46ba4d77d30",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "身处上坡时,一段时间内速度持续提升\\n＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "158c1639014738ccf31fd6a929a823456dd61362a4d000a323d4e06f3338762b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103502111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7dde0a4c6dfb0bd037692691",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在终盘的最终直线若处于好位置\\n一段时间内速度提升＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "65b41386c3c733ff3cc17726b2b48437fbcf808463678a7aac9122bd9c2e7d86",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103502211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0745ac3a037d86db06f52eba",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛终盘时位于第四名开外\\n则速度提升,若是东京比赛场的2400ｍ比赛\\n则速度大幅提升＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "864421772bb602be557f8e00fca2e2cb5817f2b516cc5a589ad9e45308f45812",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103503111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d0e58af081b9ae27f537ff9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘位于队伍中间时\\n一段时间内速度提升\\n＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c8d0599b9f011f0a78afe57e2fc9425e1a23df648cb8ec8b8b9974d8456ea58",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103503211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3e04838832179f1cb165c99",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道之后进行名次争夺,在最终直线位于前方时\\n涌现出不服输的强烈求胜心\\n速度少量加快",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd02dfbda3ab103f9b34ca9e3a0400d45e2e3cd9ebe9cec21db1be8a647b3ad7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "10351"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b031b27c747bcb268a392f95",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时若身处后方\\n则速度提升,并稍微回复持久力\\n＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "da5459afc6480701748c22c66a75dd89755f6c993da2b4db17e27a109d8ff0e7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103601111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5ad133377c71b81cf1da9cf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "身处直线时速度提升\\n并稍微向前突进\\n＜作战・追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "3dd87c798ee6ec5a1b25194a601b289a2344e306f89d637e3ed476e8d3a0db4c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103601211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35863eaa334a407f4d2d7c4d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘回复体力\\n并削减前方最多5名赛马娘的体力＜长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "714673acefcdaf733e3c5269728afd5520ecce67e781d72152e85dcc7d46a74b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103602111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4313f6fb8f23586a33aca141",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘在队伍中间被人超越时\\n向前突进,并削减前方最多5名赛马娘的体力＜长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c3e9d225d721d6ff150856924cd315010cef47ba429fbf016fdaa69336e1e77",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103602121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:974791724cc7a89669106aa5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道处于内侧的话\\n一段时间内速度上升＜长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "b17583f5d2cfa47c167c3cdab943a46e399a29538dd8ee85f6d788e37292e150",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103602211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3242cee36a463678a3e5b298",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘时赛道的选择变为更加明智\\n并且稍微向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "99d3376b17848a555962e72c8755544b31ef223a3495129a6f750886f9a7976b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103701111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65af97c7efdb13129d172e8a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最后冲刺阶段的关键时刻\\n大幅提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "d02ef1367ad379297b65b5a3f95305740333f9fee9200162f51b5c7bd1d1f05d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103701211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fdb48b37e4b5cadc114497cb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘时一段时间内\\n持续向前突进＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1ca777d535b3e490578c86dc54beabb5294d840297e187d3745a572507ca040",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103702111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9618352e553f9b4c07579fa2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "中盘回复大量体力\\n＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9db8c8e9ccc1477b912c10d0d8c76a4d4a5adb99ea26b223d0054de551c91cf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103702121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f3a87c49672c14bcf381fee",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "身处直线时,速度大幅提升＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "836454cfbb2c8c1cb6e6b3a36d6a92cf2c30a5c40f6f87c1add22a8f201b7e8c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103702211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1024c7ba5d64fcdcd6f7635",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "擅长东京竞马场的比赛\\n耐力、智力、速度大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "9aaf85cd6caae18d3dfe3155b34be31027f4e9587052cba5a2bd72bc7a99a2f8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103703111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e1dae174c9434980e010e20",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘消耗耐力\\n使速度一段时间内大幅提升\\n若是东京竞马场则不消耗耐力\\n并稍微回复耐力＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b07d95fb60140afde92d21fde590013958fc583e0cf645a19ae6b750d8817ca",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103703211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1544f292db6cdbfcf01055d4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘时若身处前方\\n则稍微向前突进\\n并小幅缩减后方赛马娘的视野＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "420a78c01042e98c6b5b2c98a9b8c5b20739aa77fac317b2b03cfa0f311d75ef",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103801111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab1b6b3266c5bbe732cd2726",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛序盘时若身处前方\\n则速度稍微提升\\n并让后方的赛马娘畏缩＜短距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc6b44b2e816ea100e02ac95473c7699f220eadd992d29e737a505982e5ca552",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103801211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:777a6a9468f9ea9f0664618c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛序盘时若身处前方\\n则速度稍微提升\\n并让后方的赛马娘畏缩＜短距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc6b44b2e816ea100e02ac95473c7699f220eadd992d29e737a505982e5ca552",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103802111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d8a699b6cb10579cbc0e77e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛中盘时,若位于前方\\n则一段时间内速度提升＜短距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "a896c5d353cbbf91f5ad305ae8fc9ef4697ab248b058e2b0b570c6555738c413",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103802121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:510b77e449cd94281c39d561",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘时,加速度提升\\n并且视野稍微变得广阔\\n＜短距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "4693bf79a83ba772118be45d339c00f1d3020f66b47819fed787bd85b94a690f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103802211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8057580a4570190d41e9ac7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最后冲刺阶段遭遇前方堵塞时\\n加速力大幅提升\\n并且小幅提升选择跑道的能力",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c0ab918da201f4684adb5dddb6959488807604d5b7d9e9a2659cbecf6c6189e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103901111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4dab140d3337b775ab0855ef",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道上从外道完成超越时\\n速度提升,并且稍微提升加速度\\n＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "4662ca82a8774ea491a53061817673e68db3313e5da6893524e14c0ec71e2baa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103901211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82e1dbf372e5fdff1f5738f7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终直线位于第二名往后\\n并距离领头4马身以内时\\n速度极大提升＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a3a087f8ddb3c61500b4f65dd1d1ee14536bfa604b4b74c350b527a2e31fdf0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103902111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac019a700aa58d7d66968670",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终直线向前突进\\n若是京都赛场则极大幅向前突进\\n＜居中・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "84f4e727e757bd931cbda392137f94c14bd02120c85792f23bd7c7082e124fa4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103902121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29b9c41c813118862d52d8a1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "下坡时速度提升\\n并稍微提升加速度\\n＜英里/中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "5451ea1f51c454df48b919ee02b4bd4f97bb9e1e2f29911ef6e49f0167839fe1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103902211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19c5020bab375f213716bff0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛中盘时若身处后方\\n回复持久力、小幅提升速度\\n并且小幅缩减前方赛马娘的速度＜英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "49cb72e7aef681a702df53bde907a0fe8161ba37e4204e4a567133e91c24b1ce",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104001111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d18107edd49be077fd78071",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘开始时若身处中间集团以后\\n则加速力提升,并且视野稍微变广\\n＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "e35049cd2fe500594675f07c25e7e3d91f1501426bfafc3cff8860b4327a2f04",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104001211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1ce7bff59401812b95e9ec0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘初段位于队伍中后方时\\n提升加速度,并在比赛剩余200m的位置\\n稍微提升速度＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "789a524f7c89cf19e0bab50dc631970202fa03d5df346bac73ea2f4d07482f0f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104001221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4e0f4b394f02e6f64b14e65",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛序盘时若身处后方\\n则前方赛马娘的行为变得迟钝\\n并且稍微回复自己的持久力＜英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c073ffc2f42477b090fbaf9ae61a263150e147b388b995b46829cfadff91093",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104002111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1390faa237a6b74b9eca1d7f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛中盘时若身处中团以后的位置,则回复持久力,并稍微提升速度\\n＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "d59b7277051e30bf7157c04a050c852eff9fd5b1a8a0a6be84ec0a14ad12e5c2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104002211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:675426d08331087127afe83e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘消耗少量耐力\\n使速度极大提升,技能发动时\\n若位于中间位置,则不消耗耐力\\n＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a2e3b5b451e36d01aac7e59a4111e5ba13946b2b4fd7203bd64c261c4040775",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104003111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdf2457e212d0bfcda2ca742",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "力量十二分强劲时,在比赛中盘大幅向前突进\\n若技能发动时处于中后方\\n则变为极大幅向前突进＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "82d89483d1487b7bfacfcdcc649552fc4a9559ba4dbe2e296eb8319bb7ac7150",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104003211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c84e7957605618d9ae8433ad",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘时提升加速度\\n并且稍微提升速度＜短距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8ad045a3750447312e1383acd0efb4b5c66af7f307b1d11b63dac627bb48f80",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104101111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1267bc381581a6413cdb1abc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时若是以巨大差距保持领先\\n则大幅提升速度＜短距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "4256750caf550f0cb0a683bde5b573ad4f09e681d3c9e24c474d3dc404dea00b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104101211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1d78602ac58384002e774db",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛终盘时处于前方\\n则速度大幅上升＜短距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2ed72475755f1b7ce095abe0ed5ccca4f0183a7d781c2e8eee0a64d0466e58c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104102111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1eea302cbd261cb56aa9a1f8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在直线一段时间内向前突进＜短距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b464e4e01a64c511036c6ae48880097d7fa1b29db78131c45f1331cdeeacbb0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104102211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd10a69e0cf42a483adcb207",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛开始时稍微向前突进\\n之后准备超越或被贴近时\\n向前突进＜短距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "3832896c8ec9740e0a474026341855f78a83e12c55dfe5318a4df53b242973ca",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104103111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1bd947a1db67dcf2bcb72159",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘初段更早时间内处于领先,\\n或在前方准备超越时,亦或\\n在终盘初段更早时间内处于前方时\\n加速力提升＜短距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "71ec9777116b45b10546936033ca11c4e728279655cba73eb35c05edd6b4961d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104103211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:deded42261b4476389513ac5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段处于前列进行名次争夺时\\n发挥爆进之力,速度加快",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ca029c93cf0b16a5d21764c4ad0dadc7a969dd72f0d4dcaea09c2b7f1fd3567",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "10411"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77a7321570ae4b80313b38ff",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "身处直线时速度提升\\n并稍微向前突进\\n＜短距离/英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9ba273350fe2c2024ca176e0e20e3b446ff0ed86bddd4a32d9fc6fe26a02144",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104201111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52a53b264b6f7f024025b482",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "进行赶超时\\n一段时间内速度持续提升\\n＜短距离/英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cb9eb345d301eeec7f6b7048b9653361e381f5a33523d9e986eadb5c379cf21",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104201211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a60178068989d48fe98ae445",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在终盘的直线上提升加速度并稍微提升速度\\n若是东京赛场则在终盘初期的直线上\\n提升加速度并稍微提升速度\\n＜短距离/英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9ef49ce95f5ffc12249435d1546e19c4763fcdf8b1ac93cafb5bd6a0584b59b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104202111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4cc50e83a835e1fe466c3ea8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘的弯道一段时间内速度少量提升\\n若技能发动时自身位于最终弯道\\n则变为一段时间内速度大幅提升\\n＜短距离/英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ae24af137ae4ab367211a77bdae0069f87394d428f8c089ad24c06d30e93550",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104202211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:388f11d40c222ca86148aba4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若最终冲刺时位于前方\\n则速度大幅提升＜沙土＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "ded9e74de7cdcac71d9344df4038662b2046eac2c5230a3e4d10eb2f4f374795",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104301111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9acfb8cd8925023c95f4978a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "擅长状态为重或是不良时的赛道\\n速度与力量大幅提升\\n＜沙土＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "c66b220713c5841f8a7c9bfa9761cc7ad446ec8303ae810fa300cf58da833ca9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104301211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9687a2904ee6f3bb10944fa9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "速度和力量稍微提升\\n若是在「重」或者「不良」马场状态下\\n所有基础能力略微提升＜沙土＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "e54d827f06246fc36750984f51d1d1d9eb1350b66639b7f566d358a9a4b2ee5b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104301221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6b30a6f5a466ad4fb6423c6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "身处下坡时,回复持久力\\n并且稍微提升速度＜作战・追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5de52679dfeaee4d7ebf6736820e13b655ea44c9d55e3981305cde5070b0527",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104401111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:894e2d2c3c5a70c6e1f40853",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘时若位于第二名之后的位置\\n则稍微向前突进,并让紧盯的\\n赛马娘感到紧张＜作战・追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "59eb2a857a5aae82abd769867b4e6da9e065a6daf7bb6aac3dde3dccfa859b55",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104401211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9743506be2d8ea349efcf33d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘一段时间内向前突进\\n＜作战・追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "fae01b3bca3205380c1b06ef712eddb1cd1d6da5ca1018d5d61991ab3131796e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104401221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:496db3b6bfa785f782b208ed",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘初段提升加速度\\n若是2200m比赛则消耗少量体力\\n使加速度在终盘初段更早时间内大幅提升\\n＜作战・追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "f51bed33613e3c59ae74b7eb9bc2b1598f5fc78e21c9cf1ab78e1ccc5d1bc4f4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104402111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3022538df48d7038dad99e0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在终盘初期更早时间内少量提升加速度\\n如果是2000m比赛,则消耗少量耐力\\n小幅向前突进＜追赶・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae0eaacf4d9e3639f138700a80137cb17c2285d5adcf85340443b7bb3865744b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104402121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:703a6a469058356d233be6b4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘消耗少量体力\\n使速度大幅提升\\n之后在终盘的最终直线处速度稍微提升\\n＜作战・追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "286975fffe6ef23fa800d792bb487a540fb1788a4dfee5f54d82f83d06b3782f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104402211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f23553277316b4c65622c4e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘时若身处前方\\n则一段时间内速度持续提升\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "716cdf4f2cbda393a3094d346a2ccaa0ad5c082d248021dde457f4c7549350ef",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104501111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2200e9ca78abaf0a83559af",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "以利落的动作过弯\\n大幅回复持久力",
      "source_fingerprint": "126625a9be697ca6650d16aecf6b7b8c5b58a8f31a2447a7ed3f7baa8d04532c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104501211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f40762135bdb9d553ec23c3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "身处弯道上时速度提升\\n并且稍微回复持久力",
      "source_fingerprint": "44cef8905337120752f00d6edb61878cbae9fe25c274860a9766eff1e874ac80",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104502111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19c078bf8ab5a796d1410540",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘遭遇前方拥堵时\\n稍微回复持久力\\n并且剥夺前方赛马娘的持久力＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "424e5e81ee8cb0abf0130837f01924fe5917484bc786ab6f805306bca7904a77",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104502211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e0dc097e17e6adaf532ca58",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘速度大幅提升\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "532441ffd6df5e734df32a163f586752bae36dacc65ee3149c2e8aba947318da",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104503111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:457fffaa5ff94b43c99451d1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近终盘位于领头或是\\n距离领头6马身以内时\\n在终盘提升加速度＜先行・长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b2068bb03c8a7274e6b0085e09b62daf3f72e5a46ce11ab73051af0301d5587",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104503211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7a90cbd16da5354cebce161",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘处于好位置时\\n持久力回复",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e840da6f513589eb3f91d109657894e66fbd62c08de278830ffa1e9337503bd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "10451"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d240c7598a924ca60a6cba5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛序盘的一段时间内\\n赛道的选择变得更加明智",
      "source_fingerprint": "e625871e1b96e643e2d43495c057c82ad879629ff9ad5cfd85abe30f3a61b70c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104601111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e538fa90c85e273024c8981",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘的一段时间内,稍微向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "b91490d3aa68be29247fa1f6c1aa914e0876ffc507d5b61a7195f109d5055162",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104601121"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
